WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.499
A useful pattern is three roles: domain and sales, video, and product.

00:00:04.499 --> 00:00:07.498
This lesson is about team of three pattern.

00:00:07.498 --> 00:00:08.622
Domain/sales, video, product.

00:00:08.622 --> 00:00:11.247
Do not treat this as theory only.

00:00:11.247 --> 00:00:14.995
Treat it as a move you can run this week.

00:00:14.995 --> 00:00:20.619
By the end, you should be able to act without waiting for a perfect plan.

00:00:20.619 --> 00:00:24.742
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

00:00:24.742 --> 00:00:29.616
Stay practical: assign roles or solo blocks before you optimize branding or tools.

00:00:29.936 --> 00:00:34.436
Even solo, assign calendar blocks to each role so nothing is orphaned.

00:00:34.436 --> 00:00:37.435
Remember the objective: assign roles or solo blocks.

00:00:37.435 --> 00:00:41.560
Write the idea in your own words before you move on.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:46.059
Name one concrete next action you can finish in under an hour.

00:00:46.059 --> 00:00:50.184
Avoid vanity work that feels busy but does not create proof.

00:00:50.184 --> 00:00:54.683
If something is unclear, simplify the promise and try a smaller version.

00:00:54.683 --> 00:00:57.308
Talk to a real person when possible.

00:00:57.308 --> 00:00:58.808
Feedback beats guessing alone.

